154
00:10:56,180 --> 00:11:01,250
Well, I don't know. I mean, for a long time, nothing.
喔，我不知道，我是說 已經很久沒有怎樣了

155
00:11:01,420 --> 00:11:05,190
But you know, actually, right before you picked me up..
但是，事實上 就在你來接我之前…

156
00:11:05,360 --> 00:11:07,920
Ross and I had a little thing.
羅斯跟我有個小小的「插曲」

157
00:11:08,130 --> 00:11:11,100
Oh, my God! I love things! What happened?
喔！我的天！我最愛小插曲！ 發生什麼事？

158
00:11:11,300 --> 00:11:14,600
Well, first he told me he liked how I looked.
嗯，他先是告訴我 他喜歡我看起來的樣子

159
00:11:14,770 --> 00:11:18,640
And then we had a little..
然後我們做了個小小的…

160
00:11:19,770 --> 00:11:22,000
eye contact.
眼神交換

161
00:11:23,440 --> 00:11:24,640
Eye contact?
眼神交換？

162
00:11:24,850 --> 00:11:26,610
I hope you were using protection.
我希望你們有用避孕措施

163
00:11:28,520 --> 00:11:34,280
Excuse me, these are from the two gentlemen at the end of the bar.
不好意思 這些是吧檯最後那兩位先生請的

164
00:11:35,620 --> 00:11:39,080
Oh, actually, I can't have another one on account of my breast milk.
喔，事實上 因為餵母乳的關係我不能多喝一杯

165
00:11:40,560 --> 00:11:41,760
Okay.
好的

166
00:11:42,360 --> 00:11:46,700
Hey, Rach, maybe there's a less disgusting way to decline a drink.
嘿，瑞秋，有沒有比較不噁心的理由 可以讓你不喝酒的

167
00:11:48,740 --> 00:11:52,330
Should we send them something back? Let's send them mashed potatoes!
我們應該回請他們什麼嗎？ 我們請他們吃馬鈴薯泥好了！

168
00:11:52,540 --> 00:11:53,870
No, wait! Don't do that!
不，等等！別那麼做！

169
00:11:54,040 --> 00:11:56,030
That'll make them think they can come over.
那樣他們就會認為他們可以過來

170
00:11:56,240 --> 00:11:57,540
So, what if they do?
所以呢？過來又如何呢？

171
