Isn't it better for him to think you're cheating on me..
讓他認為是你在欺騙我…

176
00:12:19,900 --> 00:12:22,730
than for him to think I'm cheating on him?
總比他認為我在欺騙他好吧？

177
00:12:22,940 --> 00:12:24,730
I heard it.
我自己聽到了

178
00:12:25,240 --> 00:12:27,710
I don't want him to think I'm having an affair.
我不想讓他誤會我有外遇

179
00:12:28,440 --> 00:12:31,170
All right, I've got a plan. I'll go down the fire escape..
好了，我有個計劃 我會從防火梯爬下去…

180
00:12:31,380 --> 00:12:34,540
Because all good plans start with, "I'll go down the fire escape."
所有完美的計劃都是從 「我會從防火梯爬下去」開始的

181
00:12:34,750 --> 00:12:36,110
Hear me out, woman!
聽我說完，女人！

182
00:12:37,920 --> 00:12:39,980
I'll go down the fire escape and wait.
我會從防火梯爬下去然後等著

183
00:12:40,220 --> 00:12:42,710
Then it'll be like I just got back from Tulsa.
然後就會像是我剛從土爾沙回來一樣…

184
00:12:42,890 --> 00:12:45,880
Joey and I will come in and see that there's no guy in here.
然後喬伊跟我進來 看到這裡根本沒有男人

185
00:12:46,090 --> 00:12:49,490
Aren't you afraid that Joey's gonna figure all this out?
你難道不怕喬伊會識破嗎？

186
00:12:52,770 --> 00:12:54,290
I heard it.
我自己聽到了

187
00:13:02,140 --> 00:13:04,200
- I'm gonna wait. - The scary pigeon's back?
-我要等一下 -可怕的鴿子又回來了嗎？

188
00:13:04,410 --> 00:13:06,470
It's huge.
超大的

189
