I can't believe you live in that building. My grandmother lives in that building!
我不敢相信你住在那棟公寓 我奶奶也住在那棟公寓！

190
00:13:43,880 --> 00:13:46,320
Ida Greene? No sense of personal space..
艾達葛林，沒有個人空間感…

191
00:13:46,490 --> 00:13:48,980
kind of smells like chicken, looks like a potato.
聞起來像雞，看起來像馬鈴薯

192
00:13:49,190 --> 00:13:51,890
- "Spuds" is your grandmother? - That's my bubbe!
-「洋芋」是你奶奶？ -那就是我「啊嬤」！

193
00:13:55,200 --> 00:13:58,170
So we're on our way to a couple of parties.
我們要再去幾個派對

194
00:13:58,330 --> 00:14:01,630
Maybe we could get your numbers and call if we find something fun?
或許我們可以跟你們要號碼 如果遇到好玩的，打電話給你們

195
00:14:02,400 --> 00:14:05,670
Yeah. I'm sorry, we weren't really looking for anything to happen..
我很抱歉，我們並沒有在找什麼對像

196
00:14:05,840 --> 00:14:08,370
with you guys. I have a boyfriend.
我有男朋友了

197
00:14:08,680 --> 00:14:10,700
- All right. - It's no big deal.
-好的 -沒關係

198
00:14:11,080 --> 00:14:14,010
Just out of curiosity, which one of you was for me?
只是好奇，你們哪一個喜歡我呢？

199
00:14:15,780 --> 00:14:18,680
- That would've been me. - Nice.
-是我 -很好

200
00:14:20,450 --> 00:14:23,690
Different situation, cowboy, and you would've had yourself a handful.
如果情況不同，小子 你可是會有得忙的

201
00:14:27,430 --> 00:14:31,920
So she has a boyfriend. What is your situation?
所以她有男朋友 那你的情形是怎樣呢？

202
00:14:32,370 --> 00:14:35,890
Well, it's complicated. I don't actually have a boyfriend, but..
嗯，這有點複雜 我並沒有男朋友，但是…

203
00:14:36,100 --> 00:14:38,590
Then can I have your number?
那我可以跟你要電話號碼嗎？

204
00:14:39,240 --> 00:14:40,940
I'm sorry, no.
我很抱歉，不行

205
00:14:41,410 --> 00:14:42,500
Okay.
好的

206
00:14:43,010 --> 00:14:45,270
Oh, sure!
喔，當然可以！

207
00:14:46,710 --> 00:14:49,950
Oh, my God, you're giving your real number!
喔！天啊，你給他的電話是真的！

208
00:14:51,620 --> 00:14:54,090
Okay, thanks. I'll give you a call later tonight.
好的，謝謝，我今晚會打給你

209
00:14:54,290 --> 00:14:56,150
- Great. - Bye.
-太好了 -再見

210
00:14:56,320 --> 00:14:57,590
Bye.
再見

211
00:14:59,560 --> 00:15:01,260
So that's great.
那真的太棒了

212
00:15:01,430 --> 00:15:05,130
You, Bill, Ross and Emma are gonna be so happy together.
你、比爾、羅斯、還有艾□ 會很快樂在一起

213
00:15:05,300 --> 00:15:06,730
What were you thinking?
你是在想什麼呢？

214
00:15:06,930 --> 00:15:10,340
I don't know. He was cute, and he liked me. It was an impulse.
我不知道，他很可愛然後又喜歡我 我衝動之下就給他了

215
00:15:10,840 --> 00:15:14,600
Like when I bought these shoes. They were cute and they liked me too.
就像我買這雙鞋的時候 它們很可愛而且也喜歡我

216
00:15:15,140 --> 00:15:17,370
But what about Ross? What about your moment?
那羅斯怎麼辦嗎？你們的小插曲呢？

217
00:15:18,480 --> 00:15:20,450
We had a moment. We looked at each other.
我們是有過小插曲 我們對看了彼此

218
00:15:20,610 --> 00:15:24,710
Maybe if we live together for another 10 years, we may hold hands!
或許如果我們一起住了十年 我們可能就會牽手了！

219
00:15:25,550 --> 00:15:27,610
But you were really excited about it.
但是你原本對這件事 是非常高興的

220
00:15:27,790 --> 00:15:29,810
- Don't you wanna talk to him? - No.
-你不想要跟他談嗎？ -不想

221
00:15:29,990 --> 00:15:33,120
No, because I know exactly how the conversation's gonna go.
不想，因為我完全知道 談話的結果會是怎樣

222
00:15:33,290 --> 00:15:36,320
"Hey, Ross, you know, I think we had a moment before."
「嘿！羅斯，我認為我們 剛剛有個小插曲」

223
00:15:36,500 --> 00:15:39,800
"Yeah. Me too."
「是啊，我也這麼認為」

224
00:15:39,970 --> 00:15:43,330
"Well, but I'm not sure I really want to do anything about it."
「嗯，但是我不太確定 我是不是想再更進一步」

225
00:15:43,500 --> 00:15:46,670
"Yeah. Me neither."
「是啊，我也不確定」

226
00:15:46,840 --> 00:15:48,500
"Should we just live together..
我們是不是就住在一起…

227
00:15:48,680 --> 00:15:50,840
and not tell each other how we're feeling?"
然後不要告訴彼此 我們互相的感受？

228
00:15:51,010 --> 00:15:53,950
"Yeah, that works for me."
「是啊，我沒意見」

229
00:15:55,680 --> 00:15:57,620
Yeah, I see what you mean.
是啊，我知道你的意思

230
00:15:57,790 --> 00:16:01,050
By the way, nice Ross imitation.
對了，你模仿的羅斯真像

231
00:16:01,220 --> 00:16:02,780
Your Rachel wasn't whiny enough.
你模仿的瑞秋 不夠愛發牢騷

232
00:16:02,990 --> 00:16:04,460
- Well.. Hey! - Better.
-嗯…嘿！ -好多了

233
00:16:07,060 --> 00:16:11,050
The point is maybe I should just stop waiting around for moments with Ross.
重點是我或許應該停止等待 跟羅斯之間的小插曲

234
00:16:11,230 --> 00:16:14,430
You know? I should just move on with my life.
你知道嗎？我應該要過我自己的生活了

235
00:16:14,670 --> 00:16:17,540
So really, you're moving on from Ross?
真的，你要放棄羅斯了？

236
00:16:17,710 --> 00:16:20,040
I don't know. Do I have to decide right now?
我不知道，我得要現在做決定嗎？

237
00:16:20,210 --> 00:16:23,180
You kind of just did. That guy is gonna call you tonight.
你好像已經做了 那男的今晚會打電話給你

238
00:16:23,340 --> 00:16:26,340
Ross will pick up the phone, and that's a pretty clear message.
羅斯會接起電話，這是挺明白的訊息了

239
00:16:26,550 --> 00:16:28,240
Oh, my God, Ross!
喔！天啊，羅斯！

240
00:16:28,450 --> 00:16:30,540
Ross is gonna pick up the phone.
羅斯會接起電話

241
00:16:30,720 --> 00:16:33,740
I have to get my number back. Oh, my God, he's gone!
我得拿回我的電話號碼 喔！天啊，他走了！

242
00:16:33,990 --> 00:16:37,480
"Oh, I have to get my number back! Oh, my God! He's gone!" Dead on.
「我得拿回我的電話號碼 喔！天啊，他走了！」模仿的真棒

243
00:16:51,410 --> 00:16:54,770
- You know, I'm gonna take off. - So soon?
-我想我該走了 -這麼快嗎？

244
00:16:54,940 --> 00:16:56,310
- Yeah. - Okay.
-是啊 -好的

245
00:16:56,480 --> 00:16:59,000
Well, thanks.. Thanks for the beer.
嗯，謝謝你帶啤酒過來

246
00:16:59,180 --> 00:17:02,840
- You mean lager? - Yeah. Good times.
-你是說淡啤酒吧？ -是啊，快樂時光

247
00:17:07,720 --> 00:17:10,380
- Okay. - All right.
-好的 -好了

248
00:17:24,340 --> 00:17:26,570
- Hello? - Hey, Mike, it's me.
-哈囉？ -嘿，麥克，是我

249
00:17:26,740 --> 00:17:28,670
Listen, is.. Is Ross near you?
聽著，羅斯在你旁邊嗎？

250
00:17:28,880 --> 00:17:30,400
No, I just left.
沒有，我才剛走

251
00:17:30,880 --> 00:17:34,640
And that, right there, is the most interesting conversation I've had all night.
而現在，是我今晚 有過最有趣的對話了

252
00:17:35,720 --> 00:17:36,840
Really? Okay.
真的嗎？好的

253
00:17:37,020 --> 00:17:38,780
Well, you have to go back in.
嗯，你得要再回去

254
00:17:39,590 --> 00:17:44,180
What? Go back? To the land where time stands still?
什麼？回去？回到時光暫停之地嗎？

255
00:17:44,930 --> 00:17:46,520
I'm so sorry, honey, but..
我很抱歉，親愛的，但是…

256
00:17:46,690 --> 00:17:48,680
Okay, Rachel gave this guy her number..
瑞秋給了一個男的她的電話…

257
00:17:48,900 --> 00:17:51,190
and she doesn't want Ross to answer the phone.
她不希望羅斯去接電話

258
00:17:51,400 --> 00:17:53,390
So you have to intercept all his calls.
所以你必須要攔截他所有的電話

259
00:17:53,970 --> 00:17:55,090
I can't do that!
我不能這樣做！

260
00:17:55,300 --> 00:17:58,290
- He says he can't do that. - Give me the phone.
-他說他不能那樣做 -電話給我

261
00:17:58,470 --> 00:18:02,140
Hi, Mike. Hi, listen, I know that this is a lot to ask, but you know what?
麥克，聽著，我知道這個要求很過分 但是你知道嗎？

262
00:18:02,310 --> 00:18:07,680
If you do this, Phoebe will do anything you want.
如果你照做 菲比會做一切你想要她做的事

263
00:18:07,850 --> 00:18:12,050
- Seriously, I'm talking dirty stuff. - All right. Thank you. Hello?
-真的，我說得是很下流的事 -好了，謝謝，哈囉？

264
00:18:12,220 --> 00:18:16,120
Hi, I'm sorry about her. But actually, she wasn't wrong about the dirty stuff.
嗨，我替她道歉，但事實上 關於下流的事，她說的沒錯

265
00:18:18,160 --> 00:18:19,680
All right, I'll do it.
好了，我照做

266
00:18:20,660 --> 00:18:24,560
But really, how much dirtier can it get?
但說真的，會有多下流呢？

267
00:18:25,870 --> 00:18:28,300
Oh, Mike.
喔，麥克

268
00:18:28,940 --> 00:18:31,200
Bye.
拜拜

269
00:18:35,180 --> 00:18:36,970
Hey, buddy.
嘿，老兄

270
00:18:39,550 --> 00:18:41,070
Hi.
嗨

271
00:18:41,450 --> 00:18:44,250
- Can I come back in? - Why?
-我可以回來嗎？ -為什麼？

272
00:18:45,690 --> 00:18:51,320
Well, I was just thinking about how much more we have to talk about.
嗯，我只是在想我們 還有很多東西可以聊

273
00:18:51,860 --> 00:18:54,850
But you left.
但是你走了

274
00:18:59,370 --> 00:19:00,990
That didn't take long.
那倒是挺快的

275
00:19:01,200 --> 00:19:04,760
I thought you said Tulsa was, like, a three-hour flight?
我以為你說土爾沙到這裡要飛三小時

276
00:19:05,610 --> 00:19:09,340
Well, you're forgetting about the time difference.
嗯，你忘了把時差算進去了

277
00:19:17,720 --> 00:19:20,350
- You ready? I'm gonna go in there with you. - Thanks.
-你準備好了嗎？我跟你一起進去 -謝謝

278
00:19:20,520 --> 00:19:23,010
Just in case there's more than one dude in there.
以防裡面不只有一個男的

279
00:19:24,690 --> 00:19:26,120
- Again, thanks. - Yeah.
-再一次謝謝你 -是啊

280
00:19:28,160 --> 00:19:29,530
Chandler, you're home!
錢德，你回來了！

281
00:19:29,700 --> 00:19:34,330
That's right! Your husband's home! So now the sex can stop!
沒錯！你老公回來了！ 所以現在性愛派對可以停止了！

282
00:19:41,010 --> 00:19:42,910
You know what I mean.
你知道我在說什麼

283
00:19:44,280 --> 00:19:45,400
What are you saying?
你是在說什麼？

284
00:19:45,650 --> 00:19:47,480
Joey said you're here with another man!
喬伊說你跟另一個男人在一起！

285
00:19:47,680 --> 00:19:51,410
There's no man in here! How dare you accuse me of that!
這裡根本沒有男人！ 你怎麼敢這樣誣賴我！

286
00:19:54,520 --> 00:20:00,120
All right. Then maybe you won't mind if me and my friend take a look around.
好了，那或許你不介意 我和我的「朋友」到處看看

287
00:20:04,570 --> 00:20:06,290
He can't even see us!
他根本搞不清楚狀況！

288
00:20:06,470 --> 00:20:08,800
- I kind of liked it. - Me too.
-我蠻喜歡這樣的 -我也是

289
00:20:11,910 --> 00:20:12,960
What's he doing?
他在做什麼？

290
00:20:13,170 --> 00:20:16,700
I arranged some pillows on the bed to look like a guy.
我用枕頭做成人形在床上

291
00:20:18,480 --> 00:20:23,180
Bedroom's clear. Although you might need some new pillows.
臥室沒有人 不過你們可能需要換新的枕頭了

292
00:20:23,480 --> 00:20:26,510
All right, well, I'll check the guest room.
好了，那我去檢查客房

293
00:20:34,190 --> 00:20:36,390
Why do I smell men's cologne?
我為什麼有聞到男人的古龍水味？

294
00:20:38,600 --> 00:20:40,790
I think that's you.
我想那是你的味道

295
00:20:43,300 --> 00:20:47,360
Oh, yeah. I rubbed a magazine on myself earlier.
喔，對喔，我剛剛才用 雜誌磨擦到自己身上

296
00:20:48,510 --> 00:20:50,170
There's nobody here, Joe.
裡面沒有人，喬伊

297
00:20:50,940 --> 00:20:52,000
I guess not.
我想也沒有

298
00:20:52,380 --> 00:20:56,820
I can't believe you thought I was cheating. You owe me an apology.
我不敢相信你認為我會劈腿 你要對我道歉

299
00:20:57,250 --> 00:20:59,910
- You're right. I'm so sorry. - It's an honest mistake.
-你說的對，我很抱歉 -這是出自好意的誤會

300
00:21:00,090 --> 00:21:02,210
It could happen to anybody. See you.
可能發生在任何人身上的，再見

301
00:21:02,390 --> 00:21:04,790
Wait a minute, wait a minute.
等一下，等一下

302
00:21:04,960 --> 00:21:09,120
If you just got back from Tulsa, how did your suitcase beat you here?
如果你才剛從土爾沙回來 你的行李怎麼會比你先到？

303
00:21:12,830 --> 00:21:16,200
I climbed down the fire escape, and you can't put that in the closet?
我從防火梯爬了下去 而你就不能把這個藏到衣櫥裡嗎？

304
00:21:20,270 --> 00:21:23,070
So, with the exception of the fermentation process..
所以，除了發酵過程不同之外…

305
00:21:23,240 --> 00:21:26,640
beer and ale are basically the same thing.
啤酒跟麥酒基本上是相同的東西

306
00:21:27,610 --> 00:21:30,240
Fascinating, isn't it?
真引人入勝，不是嗎？

307
00:21:30,420 --> 00:21:33,880
Maybe you should look up "fascinating."
或許你應該查一下「引人入勝」

308
00:21:35,120 --> 00:21:37,090
I'll get it!
我來接！

309
00:21:42,160 --> 00:21:46,160
Hello? Ross' place. Mike speaking.
哈囉？羅斯家，我是麥克

310
00:21:48,070 --> 00:21:49,470
It's for you.
要找你的

311
00:21:53,470 --> 00:21:56,740
I don't understand what just happened here.
我不懂剛剛發生的事

312
00:21:59,110 --> 00:22:00,810
What's going on?
是怎麼回事？

313
00:22:00,980 --> 00:22:02,110
I'm sorry.
我很抱歉

314
00:22:02,280 --> 00:22:06,410
I told you I was in Tulsa because I wanted to spend the night with Monica..
我會跟你說我在土爾沙是因為 今晚我想要跟摩妮卡在一起…

315
00:22:06,590 --> 00:22:10,420
and I didn't know.. I didn't think you'd understand.
而我不知道… 我以為你會不諒解

316
00:22:11,490 --> 00:22:15,290
You think I'm too dumb to understand a husband needs to be with his wife?
你以為我笨到會不諒解 老公想要跟老婆在一起嗎？

317
00:22:15,460 --> 00:22:18,590
You think I'm, like..
你以為我就像…

318
00:22:21,000 --> 00:22:23,700
- Joey? - Yeah.
-喬伊？ -怎樣

319
00:22:24,100 --> 00:22:27,270
I don't know what to say. We shouldn't have lied to you.
我不知道該說什麼 我們不應該欺騙你的

320
00:22:27,440 --> 00:22:30,710
I feel so bad. Is there anything I can do to make it up to you?
我覺得很難過，我能做什麼補償你嗎？

321
00:22:33,180 --> 00:22:36,550
You could go to the game with me. Even though you said you couldn't.
你可以跟我一起去看球賽 雖然你說了你不行

322
00:22:36,720 --> 00:22:41,180
But then you lied to me and tricked me and gave me a bump on the head.
但是你欺騙我 然後又害我頭腫了一包

323
00:22:41,460 --> 00:22:45,290
I'm sorry, that's the one thing I can't do. I promised I'd be with Monica.
我很抱歉，這是我唯一無法做到的 我答應摩妮卡要跟她在一起了

324
00:22:45,930 --> 00:22:47,190
All right.
好吧

325
00:22:47,960 --> 00:22:49,720
- You can go. - What?
-你去吧 -什麼？

326
00:22:49,930 --> 00:22:52,730
You should go to the game. It's okay. I want you to.
你應該去看球賽，沒關係，我要你去

327
00:22:53,200 --> 00:22:55,860
- Really? You gonna be okay? - Yeah, I'll be fine.
-真的？你沒關係嗎？ -是的，我沒關係

328
00:22:56,200 --> 00:22:59,870
You know, maybe I'll stay here and practice the art of seduction.
你知道的，或許我可以留在這裡 然後練習一下勾引的技巧

329
00:23:00,140 --> 00:23:04,670
- You're gonna put sweats on and clean. - It's gonna be so hot!
-你要換上運動服然後打掃吧 -一定會很性感撩人！

330
00:23:05,080 --> 00:23:06,310
- Bye. - Bye.
-拜 -拜

331
00:23:06,480 --> 00:23:07,640
Thanks.
謝了

332
00:23:08,550 --> 00:23:09,980
Here's your ticket.
你的外套拿去

333
00:23:10,150 --> 00:23:12,350
Thanks. Hey, listen..
謝了，嘿，聽著…

334
00:23:12,520 --> 00:23:15,150
I'm never gonna lie to you again, okay?
我再也不會跟你說謊了，好嗎？

335
00:23:15,360 --> 00:23:18,590
And I want you to know that nobody thinks you're stupid.
而且我要你知道沒有人認為你是愚蠢的

336
00:23:19,260 --> 00:23:20,490
Thanks, man.
謝了，老兄

337
00:23:23,760 --> 00:23:27,100
- Where you going? - Game's tomorrow night, Joe.
-你要去哪？ -球賽是明晚，喬伊

338
00:23:39,010 --> 00:23:41,610
I'm glad I got to talk to your mom. She sounds nice.
我很高興跟你媽說到話 她聽起來人不錯

339
00:23:41,780 --> 00:23:44,110
Yeah, she's a peach.
是啊，她人很好

340
00:23:47,490 --> 00:23:48,920
Oh, God!
喔！天啊！

341
00:23:49,090 --> 00:23:51,960
So glad you're back!
真高興你們回來了！

342
00:23:53,090 --> 00:23:54,690
So, what did you guys do?
那你們做了些什麼呢？

343
00:23:54,930 --> 00:23:57,690
You know, we just drank some beer.
你知道的，我們喝了一些啤酒

344
00:23:57,860 --> 00:24:00,590
Mike played with the boundaries of normal social conduct.
麥克示範了正常社交禮儀的界線在哪

345
00:24:01,840 --> 00:24:04,670
It's true, I did.
是真的，我做得很好

346
00:24:05,570 --> 00:24:06,600
- Well, goodbye. - Okay.
-好了，再見 -好的

347
00:24:06,810 --> 00:24:09,370
- Bye. That was fun, Phoebe. - I know. It was fun.
-拜，真好玩，菲比 -我知道，真好玩

348
00:24:09,580 --> 00:24:11,340
See you, guys.
再見！

349
00:24:11,510 --> 00:24:13,710
Lock the door! Lock the door, seriously.
鎖門！鎖門，快點

350
00:24:15,380 --> 00:24:18,080
Shoot, I forgot to pay Phoebe for the drinks.
糟了，我忘記給菲比酒錢了

351
00:24:20,120 --> 00:24:23,490
Wait, wait. Wait, sorry. Did he call? Did that guy call?
等等，等一下，不好意思 他有打來嗎？那個男的有打來嗎？

352
00:24:23,660 --> 00:24:25,150
No, just his mom.
沒有，只有他媽打來

353
00:24:25,390 --> 00:24:26,620
Around 8:30?
在八點半左右嗎？

354
00:24:26,830 --> 00:24:28,390
- Yeah. - Then again at 9:00?
-是的 -然後九點再一通嗎？

355
00:24:28,900 --> 00:24:30,830
Yeah.
是的

356
00:24:36,270 --> 00:24:38,360
Hello?
哈囉？

357
00:24:38,710 --> 00:24:42,040
No, she's not here right now. Can I take a message?
她現在不在，要留言嗎？

358
00:24:42,880 --> 00:24:45,780
Bill from the bar?
酒吧認識的比爾？

359
00:24:47,050 --> 00:24:52,450
Okay, Bill from the bar, I'll make sure she gets your number.
好的，酒吧認識的比爾 我會把你的號碼給她的

360
00:25:03,600 --> 00:25:05,930
So.. So how was it?
好玩嗎？

361
00:25:06,100 --> 00:25:08,230
Did you guys..? You guys have a good time?
你們有…？ 你們玩的開心嗎？

362
00:25:08,400 --> 00:25:12,900
We had so much fun. It felt so good to be out.
我們玩的很開心，出去玩真是快樂

363
00:25:15,710 --> 00:25:17,300
Rach?
瑞秋？

364
00:25:17,480 --> 00:25:19,570
Yeah?
什麼事呢？

365
00:25:22,380 --> 00:25:23,540
Never mind.
沒事

366
00:25:30,960 --> 00:25:33,590
- Hey, you guys. - Hey!
-嗨，你們 -嘿！

367
00:25:33,760 --> 00:25:37,290
I'll be right back. I gotta go to the bathroom.
馬上回來，我要去上廁所

368
00:25:51,910 --> 00:25:54,310
Stout. That's a kind of beer.
黑啤酒也是啤酒的一種

369
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000


370
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000
